{"unit_id":"tag:0ADQ:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），这些空间在<MATH_0003>上。<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 给定一个代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0004>，它在<MATH_0005>上，我们有<MATH_0006>相对于<MATH_0007>的<TEXTITOPEN_0001>平凡下降数据（trivial descent datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，即<MATH_0008>上的恒等态射（identity morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 由引理<REF_0001>，得到<MATH_0009>相对于<MATH_0010>的<TEXTITOPEN_0002>典范下降数据（canonical descent datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，它通过沿<MATH_0011>拉回平凡下降数据（trivial descent datum）得到。我们常以<MATH_0012>记这个下降（descent）数据。\n<STRUCT_0004> 一个下降（descent）数据<MATH_0013>，相对于<MATH_0014>，称为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>有效的（effective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，如果<MATH_0015>同构（isomorphic）于典范下降数据（canonical descent datum）<MATH_0016>，对于某个代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0017>在<MATH_0018>上。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"trivial descent datum","target_term":"平凡下降数据"},{"source_term":"identity morphism","target_term":"恒等态射"},{"source_term":"canonical descent datum","target_term":"典范下降数据"},{"source_term":"trivial descent datum","target_term":"平凡下降数据"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效的"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"canonical descent datum","target_term":"典范下降数据"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"trivial descent datum","target_term":"平凡下降数据","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"identity morphism","target_term":"恒等态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"canonical descent datum","target_term":"典范下降数据","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效的","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ADF:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>因此，有效（effective）意味着存在一个代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0001>在<MATH_0002>上，以及一个同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>上，使得<MATH_0005>等于复合（composition）<MATH_0006>。这里有一个小问题：当<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>是概形（schemes）时，这个定义（就其精神而言）与《下降（Descent）》的定义<REF_0001>中的定义冲突。然而，我们所指的版本总能由上下文明确。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ADR:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是一个态射族（family of morphisms），这些态射的源和目标为<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces），且目标固定为<MATH_0004>。<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 给定一个代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>上，我们在代数空间（algebraic spaces）族<MATH_0007>上有一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>典范下降数据（canonical descent datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，它通过拉回<MATH_0008>相对于<MATH_0009>的平凡下降（descent）数据得到。我们将这个下降（descent）数据记为<MATH_0010>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 一个下降（descent）数据<MATH_0011>，相对于<MATH_0012>，称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>有效的（effective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果存在一个代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0013>在<MATH_0014>上，使得<MATH_0015>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0016>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"canonical descent datum","target_term":"典范下降数据"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效的"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"canonical descent datum","target_term":"典范下降数据","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效的","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
