{"unit_id":"tag:0ADS:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>本节是《下降（Descent）》的节<REF_0001>的对应版本。它略有不同，因为代数空间（algebraic spaces）已经是层（sheaves）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
